   >> Cross-session survival log:
      session 0: {'session': 0, 'validated': 1, 'demoted': 0, 'shown_as_3x': False, 'shown_as_2x': True}
      session 1: {'session': 1, 'validated': 1, 'demoted': 0, 'shown_as_3x': True, 'shown_as_2x': False}
      session 2: {'session': 2, 'validated': 1, 'demoted': 0, 'shown_as_3x': True, 'shown_as_2x': False}
   >> A persistent false claim can ride from 2x to 3x across sessions
      with FRESH episode evidence each time — no cross-session check
